    "detailed_description": "<h1>About Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo build includes one available character, 30 unique items, one normal map and endless mode. Also includes a leaderboard for endless mode, which is separated from the full game. Player's data can be inherited in full game (except leaderboard record).</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Contact: <a href=\"mailto:jackwdev@outlook.com\">jackwdev@outlook.com</a></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feel free to discuss the game, share feedback and report any bugs with me. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your support means a lot :)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>* Simplicity in Complexity *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Path to the Void </i>is a \u201cDiablo-like\u201d, gear-driven looter combined with slight roguelike component where you slaughter, level up, and explore endless realms. Crush mighty or grotesque bosses, rapidly assemble your dream build, and revel in hoarder\u2019s euphoria\u2014perfect for a quick session between coffee breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/8e594e289a34c4f8f8dc94cc4ed42d0f.poster.avif?t=1748546840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/8e594e289a34c4f8f8dc94cc4ed42d0f.webm?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/8e594e289a34c4f8f8dc94cc4ed42d0f.mp4?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>* Endless Buildcraft *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ weapons &amp; gear with wild effects (and growing!), paired with massive attribute ranges that test your luck\u2014dominate through sheer numbers or laugh at RNG\u2019s whims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/410239be58a2728c9e9ae9d788e07a74.poster.avif?t=1748546840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/410239be58a2728c9e9ae9d788e07a74.webm?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/410239be58a2728c9e9ae9d788e07a74.mp4?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique classes, 6 debuff types \u2013 slaughter mobs your way. Burn them? Poison them? Or why not both?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game-breaking synergies defy class stereotypes: <i>Mages</i> can also tank hits like unyielding fortresses and <i>Clerics</i> deliver bone-crushing melee &quot;blessings&quot; to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/405231e4e2942f00c654cc0761a50af4.poster.avif?t=1748546840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/405231e4e2942f00c654cc0761a50af4.webm?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/405231e4e2942f00c654cc0761a50af4.mp4?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>So, what do you say, my friend? Come and join me!</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Contact: <a href=\"mailto:jackwdev@outlook.com\">jackwdev@outlook.com</a></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feel free to discuss the game, share feedback and report any bugs with me. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your support means a lot :)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>* Simplicity in Complexity *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Path to the Void </i>is a \u201cDiablo-like\u201d, gear-driven looter combined with slight roguelike component where you slaughter, level up, and explore endless realms. Crush mighty or grotesque bosses, rapidly assemble your dream build, and revel in hoarder\u2019s euphoria\u2014perfect for a quick session between coffee breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/8e594e289a34c4f8f8dc94cc4ed42d0f.poster.avif?t=1748546840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/8e594e289a34c4f8f8dc94cc4ed42d0f.webm?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/8e594e289a34c4f8f8dc94cc4ed42d0f.mp4?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>* Endless Buildcraft *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ weapons &amp; gear with wild effects (and growing!), paired with massive attribute ranges that test your luck\u2014dominate through sheer numbers or laugh at RNG\u2019s whims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/410239be58a2728c9e9ae9d788e07a74.poster.avif?t=1748546840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/410239be58a2728c9e9ae9d788e07a74.webm?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/410239be58a2728c9e9ae9d788e07a74.mp4?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique classes, 6 debuff types \u2013 slaughter mobs your way. Burn them? Poison them? Or why not both?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game-breaking synergies defy class stereotypes: <i>Mages</i> can also tank hits like unyielding fortresses and <i>Clerics</i> deliver bone-crushing melee &quot;blessings&quot; to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/405231e4e2942f00c654cc0761a50af4.poster.avif?t=1748546840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/405231e4e2942f00c654cc0761a50af4.webm?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622670/extras/405231e4e2942f00c654cc0761a50af4.mp4?t=1748546840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>So, what do you say, my friend? Come and join me!</strong></i></p>",
    "short_description": "Path to the Void is a \u201cDiablo-like\u201d gear-driven loot game with slight roguelike component. Fight and survive, uncover bizarre and wondrous gear and embrace the endless challenge. Dominate the ever-shifting chaos with your own unique builds and try to get yourself shown on the leaderboard!",
